---
import { Picture } from "astro:assets";
import heroImage from "@/assets/4389.jpg";
import Link from "@/components/ui/link.astro";
import { Icon } from "astro-icon/components";
---

<main
  class="grid lg:grid-cols-2 place-items-center pt-16 pb-8 md:pt-12 md:pb-24">
  <div class="py-6 md:order-1 hidden md:block">
    <Picture
      src={heroImage}
      alt="Astronaut in the air"
      widths={[200, 400, 600]}
      sizes="(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 620px"
      loading="eager"
      format="avif"
    />
  </div>
  <div>
    <h1
      class="text-5xl lg:text-6xl xl:text-7xl font-bold lg:tracking-tight xl:tracking-tighter">
      Hi Tech Soft Solution
    </h1>
    <p class="text-lg mt-4 text-slate-600 max-w-xl">
    A business support tool like Tally, enables you to manage your day-to-day accounting and monitor the financial health of your organisation.<wbr /> This ultimately leads to increased productivity and profitability. But, when you are confronted with new business challenges, your business support systems need to measure up and deliver more, to ensure that your business continues to run smoothly.


    </p>
    <div class="mt-6 flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-3">
      <Link
        href="#"
        class="flex gap-1 items-center justify-center"
        rel="noopener">
        Read More
      </Link>
      <Link
        size="lg"
        style="outline"
        rel="noopener"
        href="#"
        class="flex gap-1 items-center justify-center"
        >
        <Icon class="text-blue w-4 h-4" name="uil:phone" />
        Contact Us
      </Link>
    </div>
  </div>
</main>
